k":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T03:53:52-08:00","id":1528311,"title":"","content":"Mon\u00e7ada if I'm already embraced, Beckett otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27825-mrdrika","name":"MrDrika","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27825_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T05:39:24-08:00","id":1528312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurkhal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528277-which-vtm-npc-could-you-see-being-on-good-terms-with?p=1528294#post1528294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">None of them.<br /> <br /> They are predators and I'm their prey. Whatever illusion or delusion we may engage in as previously mentioned I wouldn't want to court death for the sake of hanging along with someone who'se nature it is to harm me, at best.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much yeah, except my intent would be to hunt then.<br /> <br /> Wipe them out, all of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T10:36:53-08:00","id":1528331,"title":"","content":"I'm going to come up with a more refined post based on this topic and I hope I get some comments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T08:01:50-08:00","id":1528926,"title":"","content":"I guess some of Tremere Vampires could at least have some sympathy for me. They respect intelectual pursuits and clearly defined interests, and also have it that once a person is with them they will give them at least some consideration. I have a honest interest in literature of all kind despite not attending university or a career in this regard. I will take any good and well written and researched book that is available no matter the situation ( in the bus, while waiting for a doctor, or during the start of an evening etc. ) and classics like the Song of Ice and Fire, Lord of the Rings, Conan the Barbarian, the Witcher series have a great pull for me. I also like stability, peace and quiet, and ambition. <br /> <br /> Aisling Sturbridge or Elif Parmak do seem friendly and interesting to me, and I have to say the Inner Counsellors ( especially the Counsellor of Africa Elaine the Calinot ) are some of my favourite characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-21T16:47:44-08:00","id":1529116,"title":"","content":"I can't think of a single VtM NPC that I'd want to meet, much less become friends with. There are plenty that are entertaining to encounter in the context of a game, but I would want that layer of distance provided by my player characters rather than having any personal interaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}